# Normalise every text file to LF in the repository.
#
# This repo was first populated through the GitHub web uploader, which left a
# mix of CRLF and LF blobs -- so editing a file on Windows could rewrite every
# line of it and bury a two-line change in a thousand-line diff.  Declaring the
# convention here fixes it once: Git stores LF and checks out whatever the
# platform wants.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never touched.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.mat  binary
*.npy  binary
*.npz  binary
*.edf  binary
*.dat  binary
*.zip  binary
